// s5-policy/s5_policy_core.vsm — authority gradient + license + module migration
// Fused: @src_strategic_auth (ratified 2026-06-21) + @src_license_audit
//        (rmw3 2026-07-20, theme D) + @src_module_migr (rmw3 2026-06-05).
// ¬fused: covenant / covenant_ops — absorbed in PH-00 BOOT as
